<title>UK: Vencemos unit sets $75 million two-year bond.</title>
<headline>Vencemos unit sets $75 million two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Chase.</p>
<p> BORROWER   VENCEMOS FINANCIAL INVESTMENTS LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  CORPORACION VENEZOLANA DE CEMENTOS SACA.</p>
<p> AMT    $75 MLN	 COUPON     8.625     MATURITY    19.NOV.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    19.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.875     REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	+288 BP</p>
<p> SALE LIMS  US	  LISTING    LUX	 PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC   0.625</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND TWO-YEAR U.S. TREASURY</p>
<p> NOTES	LAUNCHED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
